      "Probing the local dev servers on 127.0.0.1 ports 3001 and 5173 is fine."
    ],
    "block_instructions": [
      "Force pushing, rewriting published history, or deleting branches still requires approval.",
      "Sending this repository's credentials or API keys to an external host still requires approval, even for diagnosis."
    ]
  }
